abstract: >-
  A hands-on ethical hacking curriculum built on The Carpentries
  Workbench, teaching packet capture and traffic analysis, scanning
  and enumeration, exploitation, and post-exploitation techniques
  using isolated Docker Compose lab environments. Ported from the
  companion Hacking-Labs-Training repository as a pilot episode.
